[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3316022088","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110713#issuecomment-3316022088","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110713","id":3316022088,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FpntI","user":{"login":"chocola-mint","id":56677134,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2Njc3MTM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56677134?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint","html_url":"https://github.com/chocola-mint","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-21T14:14:48Z","updated_at":"2025-09-21T16:26:58Z","body":"@KoBeWi \r\n\r\nOh boy, this is trickier than expected. 😅\r\n\r\nInspired by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110722, I've optimized my implementation quite a bit.\r\n\r\nIn this new implementation, `editor_description` is now stored directly in every Resource (`.tres` and `.res`)'s header tag. This means you can use `ResourceLoader::get_editor_description()` to quickly extract the editor description from a path without loading the entire Resource into memory. This is probably as optimized as it can get.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1674\" height=\"772\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f57c5e8e-dcb1-452c-aab2-697304d61630\" />\r\n\r\nAlso note that as only `.tres` and `.res` files can possibly have editor descriptions, other file formats like PNGs won't be a performance concern. (`ResourceLoader::get_editor_description()` will look at their file extension and just return an empty string)\r\n\r\nFor Resources that don't use the `.tres` format, their `editor_description` will be disabled in the editor.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"560\" height=\"458\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/024b7cb4-5c12-4cc9-898c-5e35e4e2ac3f\" />\r\n\r\nIt's possible for custom resource formats to provide their own editor descriptions, (for example, custom JSON-based level formats authored in an external editor) but I think that can be a different proposal. For now, `ResourceFormatLoader::get_editor_description()` is left as a virtual method unexposed to ClassDB.\r\n\r\nAlso related to the other proposal: I can remove support for editor descriptions in `.res` (binary version of `.tres`, AFAIK only used in exported projects) if optimization in non-editor builds is a concern.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3316022088/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3329733358","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110713#issuecomment-3329733358","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110713","id":3329733358,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Gd7Lu","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-24T16:15:31Z","updated_at":"2025-09-24T16:15:40Z","body":"> binary version of `.tres`, AFAIK only used in exported projects)\r\n\r\n`.res` can be saved in projects directly, which is typically done for VoxelGIData or LightmapGIData to reduce file size and speed up loading/saving.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3329733358/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3338941869","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110713#issuecomment-3338941869","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110713","id":3338941869,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HBDWt","user":{"login":"chocola-mint","id":56677134,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2Njc3MTM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56677134?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint","html_url":"https://github.com/chocola-mint","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-26T14:19:29Z","updated_at":"2025-09-26T14:19:29Z","body":"> `.res` can be saved in projects directly, which is typically done for VoxelGIData or LightmapGIData to reduce file size and speed up loading/saving.\r\n\r\nUpdated so Resources using the .res format also have their `editor_description` editable in the inspector.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3338941869/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3341788411","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110713#issuecomment-3341788411","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110713","id":3341788411,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HL6T7","user":{"login":"chocola-mint","id":56677134,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2Njc3MTM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56677134?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint","html_url":"https://github.com/chocola-mint","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-27T14:12:37Z","updated_at":"2025-09-27T14:12:37Z","body":"@Calinou \r\n\r\nI completely forgot to verify sub resources, my bad!\r\n\r\nFor sub resources, as tooltips that show editor descriptions aren't needed here (this behavior is the same as NodePaths) I've decided to simply store them as a simple property. This also automatically provides backwards compatibility for binary formats. (And is likely the only possible solution for them, as binary sub resources don't have their own string tables)\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1716\" height=\"269\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/30e4f570-c206-485b-9cb2-e9b58a97b524\" />\r\n\r\nAs for main resources with binary formats, I've decided to store editor description in the resource's string table instead. This allows older loaders to still load the resource safely, while still allowing `recognize_editor_description()` to quickly retrieve the editor description for tooltips. `ResourceLoader::has_editor_description_support()` is now used to determine if there is any ResourceFormatLoader that supports editor descriptions for a given type.\r\n\r\n> * Binary resources saved with this PR can't be opened in `master` afterwards.\r\n> * When you use **Make Unique** in the inspector, the editor description is lost.\r\n\r\nI've verified these issues on my local build. They should be fixed now.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3341788411/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"