l":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-30T15:17:25Z","updated_at":"2025-09-30T15:17:25Z","body":"The description shows in EditorSettings 🙃\r\n<img width=\"909\" height=\"314\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fed58281-4dc0-433f-863c-0a69e1630c0a\" />\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3352701220/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3352779286","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110713#issuecomment-3352779286","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110713","id":3352779286,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7H11oW","user":{"login":"chocola-mint","id":56677134,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2Njc3MTM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56677134?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint","html_url":"https://github.com/chocola-mint","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-30T15:35:39Z","updated_at":"2025-09-30T15:35:39Z","body":"> If you put `\"` into the description, it's not escaped properly and the Resource file becomes \"corrupted\". Similar thing with `\\`.\r\n\r\nShould be fixed now:\r\n<img width=\"743\" height=\"313\" alt=\"2025-09-30 235757\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b7b6f058-f33e-4fb2-97dc-cc5b0298e7a7\" />\r\n\r\nNote that the bug only affected text formats.\r\n\r\n> The description shows in EditorSettings 🙃 <img alt=\"image\" width=\"909\" height=\"314\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/2223172/495764948-fed58281-4dc0-433f-863c-0a69e1630c0a.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..KN7wkUD-BENV-P8poopbyWx71QH-e41OfesHOJ53fjo\">\r\n\r\nThat caught me off guard. I thought DocTools was the only part of the editor that needed to handle this special case. Should be fixed now:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"870\" height=\"220\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/89355752-6a27-4452-8fa4-2c13ceb1aca8\" />","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3352779286/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3406654826","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110713#issuecomment-3406654826","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110713","id":3406654826,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7LDW1q","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-15T14:13:34Z","updated_at":"2025-10-15T14:25:10Z","body":"I still see Global category for some reason 🤔\r\n<img width=\"206\" height=\"213\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0345b758-b884-4af4-89ee-45356b1b4113\" />\r\nI might have some garbage settings from testing various pull requests, but the category did not show up before this PR, so something is wrong.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3406654826/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3406829134","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110713#issuecomment-3406829134","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110713","id":3406829134,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7LEBZO","user":{"login":"chocola-mint","id":56677134,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2Njc3MTM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56677134?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint","html_url":"https://github.com/chocola-mint","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-15T14:46:13Z","updated_at":"2025-10-15T14:46:13Z","body":"@KoBeWi \r\nI rebased and tested again but the Global category is still not showing up for me.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"886\" height=\"440\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4fa42960-9a56-4734-ad41-90aedbdd29b3\" />\r\n\r\nMind if I ask what else is shown in the Global category on your end?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3406829134/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3407469857","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110713#issuecomment-3407469857","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110713","id":3407469857,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7LGd0h","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-15T17:11:16Z","updated_at":"2025-10-15T17:11:58Z","body":"I had some `show_search` and `collapse` settings (probably from #108351), but after removing them, I still see the category. It's just empty 🤷‍♂️\r\n\r\nHere's my settings file:\r\n[editor_settings-4.6.tres.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22932665/editor_settings-4.6.tres.zip)\r\n\r\nIf I had to guess, it might be caused by `_validate_property()` in Resource.\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3407469857/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3410838539","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110713#issuecomment-3410838539","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110713","id":3410838539,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7LTUQL","user":{"login":"chocola-mint","id":56677134,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2Njc3MTM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56677134?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint","html_url":"https://github.com/chocola-mint","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-16T13:13:29Z","updated_at":"2025-10-16T13:22:45Z","body":"@KoBeWi \r\n\r\nI finally figured out why it wasn't showing up for me. I had to enable Advanced Settings to get it to appear!\r\n\r\n<img width=\"888\" height=\"258\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/49654117-545a-4a7c-ab69-9fad69a2ea6b\" />\r\n\r\nI was missing another location that needed to be told specifically to ignore the `editor_description` property - `SectionedInspector::update_category_list()`.\r\n\r\nThis has been fixed now.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"886\" height=\"300\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3e41e1ae-9c62-4572-a781-4fba11dd73bf\" />\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nOn a semi-related note, I just grepped the string `== \"resource_path\" ||` and found another spot that I missed: `EditorAnimationMultiTransitionEdit::_get_property_list()` (in `animation_state_machine_editor.cpp`) This is getting silly now. 😅\r\n\r\nMaybe it's time to end this code duplication and unify this logic with a utility function?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3410838539/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3411943703","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110713#issuecomment-3411943703","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110713","id":3411943703,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7LXiEX","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-16T17:25:32Z","updated_at":"2025-10-16T17:25:32Z","body":"> Maybe it's time to end this code duplication and unify this logic with a utility function?\r\n\r\nYeah, that would be nice I think.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3411943703/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3414900174","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110713#issuecomment-3414900174","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110713","id":3414900174,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Liz3O","user":{"login":"chocola-mint","id":56677134,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2Njc3MTM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56677134?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint","html_url":"https://github.com/chocola-mint","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-17T10:36:48Z","updated_at":"2025-10-17T10:36:48Z","body":"> > Maybe it's time to end this code duplication and unify this logic with a utility function?\r\n> \r\n> Yeah, that would be nice I think.\r\n\r\nI've added the static function `Object::editor_is_object_or_resource_property()` to address this.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nOne thing of note is that SectionedInspector (in `editor_sectioned_inspector.cpp`) also checks `pi.name.begins_with(\"_global_script\")`. This seems to only affect `ProjectSettings`'s `\"_global_script_classes\"` and `\"_global_script_class_icons\"` properties, both of which are deprecated.\r\n\r\nI've left the additional check as-is for now.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3414900174/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3638069832","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110713#issuecomment-3638069832","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110713","id":3638069832,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Y2IpI","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-10T16:59:38Z","updated_at":"2025-12-10T17:01:20Z","body":"We discussed this feature in the core meeting.\r\nThe implementation looks good going by @KoBeWi's approval.\r\nSince this is touching a core class, we'd like to be sure that this feature is needed by enough people to warrant it being merged. We'd also like to see more use-cases that cannot be solved with the `Node` `editor_description` on the proposal.\r\nSo we'll continue to monitor the proposal for now.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3638069832/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5717499857","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110713#issuecomment-5717499857","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110713","id":5717499857,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVMof0Q","user":{"login":"MatthiasBae","id":52577744,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNTc3NzQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52577744?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae","html_url":"https://github.com/MatthiasBae","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-17T16:06:55Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T16:06:55Z","body":"> We discussed this feature in the core meeting. The implementation looks good going by @KoBeWi's approval. Since this is touching a core class, we'd like to be sure that this feature is needed by enough people to warrant it being merged. We'd also like to see more use-cases that cannot be solved with the `Node` `editor_description` on the proposal. So we'll continue to monitor the proposal for now.\r\n\r\nIn [4.8 dev 4 the Visual Shader Node Groups have been introduced](https://godotengine.org/article/dev-snapshot-godot-4-8-dev-4/#shaders-visualshader-node-groups). They would be the perfect usecase for a proper Resource Description in the Editor.\r\n\r\n(Also left a comment on my proposal)\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13221#issuecomment-5717468022","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5717499857/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]